  "@spotUrgencyDueSoon": {
    "description": "The name of rank 2, used where it labels a GROUP of Spots (a filter chip, a dashboard tile) and a single date cannot be shown. Was 'Diese Woche fällig', which claimed a calendar week over what is really a window proportional to the interval — and while that window was a fixed seven days, every Spot carried this label forever (eiermann-uga). A single row says the day count instead, see spotDueInDays."
