    "description": "The due line of ONE Spot. A count rather than a rank name, because the rank restated the date worse than the date does — 'Diese Woche fällig · fällig am 24.08.' says fällig twice and adds nothing. Computed in the CLIENT on local calendar days: nest_state's header refuses a days column in SQL because SQLite's DATE('now') is UTC and the difference would be a day out in CET.",
